    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Gnolls often seem very aggressive to other creatures - partially because gnolls themselves don’t consider such casual intimidation to be a hostile act. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to intimidation checks made while in exploration mode, and a +1 circumstance bonus to your Will DC against Intimidate skill actions, such as Demoralize.</p>"
    },
